40900","kind":"announcement","title":"Vice Club Simulator Is Joining Steam Next Fest! Demo Out Now","summary":"Hey, Boss! Vice Club Simulator is joining Steam Next Fest from October 19–26, and we’re opening the club doors early! Our free demo is now available to everyone on Steam. You can start playing today, ahead of the festival. No invitation or key needed! It’s time to take charge of your own nightclub. Plan your dancer line-up, stock the bar, look after your VIP guests, and handle the trouble that comes with running the place. Keeping the drinks flowing and the customers happy is now your responsibi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:08:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4240900-1845383656386936","game_id":"steam-4240900","kind":"announcement","title":"Vice Club Simulator’s Demo Coming to Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hey everyone!We’re excited to share the first trailer for Vice Club Simulator, our nightclub management game. Choose your dancers, stock the bar, hire staff, and keep the business running when the night takes an unexpected turn.A playable demo is coming to Steam Next Fest, giving you a chance to experience both the preparations before opening and the challenges of running a busy night.A good night starts before the doors openBefore your first customers arrive, you’ll need to get everything ready","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T16:12:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4240900-1841579228665843","game_id":"steam-4240900","kind":"announcement","title":"The Doors Are Open — Vice Club Simulator Is Now on Steam!","summary":"Plan the Night. Manage the Chaos. Vice Club Simulator is not about partying the night away. It’s about running it. Before the doors open, the club is already alive. Build your line-up, prepare the bar, set the mood, and make sure everything is ready for the night ahead. Once the crowd arrives, every decision is yours and so are the consequences. The Club Is Yours to Run Build your line-up. Manage your dancers. Stock the bar. Keep the VIPs happy. Put out problems before they turn into chaos. Then","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T14:46:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4240900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4240900":"2026-10-26T01:49:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4240900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4660850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4240900","app_id":4240900,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1420f9caa3f6b138ecfe7e750552e3074e5fafc4261540b958609d74383457ac","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Vice Club Simulator에서 나만의 나이트클럽을 맨땅에서 시작해 최고의 클럽으로 키워 보세요! 재능 있는 댄서들을 고용하고, 그녀들과 깊은 유대감을 쌓으며 도시에서 가장 핫한 라인업을 완성하세